# Gateway Focus 15 — "No Time" — ~34 min — F10 base -> add upper-theta ~7 Hz -> long timeless hold -> liminal soft-off
# Goal: Monroe Hemi-Sync Gateway "Focus 15" (No Time). Build the Focus-10 stack
#       (mind awake / body asleep) then extend into Focus 15 by adding the ~7 Hz
#       upper-theta signature layers. Focus 15 is the state of timelessness, so the
#       core is a VERY steady, minimal-change "no-time" hold, closing with a gentle
#       fade toward silence (liminal), not an alerting wake-up.
# Method: BINAURAL — headphones REQUIRED (each layer is a true L/R carrier pair;
#         beat = freq_r - carrier). One audio channel per layer, pan 0 (centered).
#
# Measured layer table (reports/session_research/gateway_focus_construction_guide.md §1):
#   Focus 10 base : 100[1.5] delta  · 200[4.0] · 250[4.0] · 300[4.0] theta
#   Focus 15 add  : 500[7.05] · 630[7.1] · 750[7.0]  (upper-theta ~7 Hz signature)
#
# PATENT UPGRADE (reports/session_research/monroe_patents_guide.md §4a/§4b, US 5,356,368):
#   The dominant 4 Hz theta bed (the 200[4.0] pair) is now a SEPTON multi-carrier stack —
#   L 200/204/208 vs R 204/208/212 → simultaneous 4 Hz binaural AND monaural beats,
#   speaker-robust (guide §4b). A phased PINK-noise bed (wave 5, pan-LFO L<->R 6 s,
#   -18 dB under the dominant) rides beneath the beats for the claimed +30% FFR (guide §4a).
#   Layer vols re-staged to the patent mix convention (guide §3): dominant ~65 (septon
#   3x22), secondary theta/delta -10..-12 dB, 7 Hz signature -12 dB, pink bed -18 dB.
# Channel map: ch1=100[1.5] delta  · SEPTON ch8=200 ch9=204 ch10=208 (4 Hz) ·
#              ch3=250[4.0] ch4=300[4.0] theta · ch5=500[7.05] ch6=630[7.1] ch7=750[7.0] ·
#              ch11=pink bed (phased L<->R, 6 s)
# Amplitudes: septon 4 Hz theta ~22 ea (dominant ~65 total); secondary theta/delta ~20-30;
#             7 Hz signature ~18 (subtle); pink bed ~8 (-18 dB).
#
# LED (SAFETY §3/§4): flicker held at 4 Hz theta the WHOLE session — well under the
#   12 Hz limit and far below the 15-25 Hz photosensitive band. Dim violet, brightness
#   <=25% with a 15 s ramp-in and a gentle breathing LFO; kept calm/steady to honor
#   the "no-time" stillness. The 7 Hz audio layers are entrainment-only; the light
#   never chases them. No saturated-red strobe, no red<->blue. Volume fades in 60 s.
#
# Ramp convention = animate-on-start (guidelines 5a): a > prefix sits on the row where
# a segment BEGINS; its value is the start, the target is the next same-channel/field
# row's value, swept over the gap. A layer is introduced by starting its channel at the
# phase time and fading its volume in.

# --- Prep / fade-in (00:00-03:00): calm 100[1.5] delta, LED + vol ease in ---
0 4 50 >0 90 0 200 15            # LED 4 Hz theta, violet, brightness ramps 0->22% over 15 s
A 0 100 0 >0 0 1 101.5 7  # ch1 delta 100[1.5]: vol fades 0->20 over 60 s
A 0 200 ~-100:100:6000 >0 0 11 0 5   # ch11 phased PINK bed: pan L<->R 6 s, vol fades 0->8
S 3000 default 65 "Settle in, let the body go loose and heavy, and let your breathing slow all on its own."
15000 4 50 22 90 0 200 15        # brightness reaches 22% (ramp-in >=15 s done)
30000 4 50 ~16:24:12000 90 0 200 15   # gentle breathing: brightness sine 16<->24% over 12 s
A 60000 100 0 20 0 1 101.5 7  # ch1 delta reaches vol 20, held (secondary, -10 dB)
A 60000 200 ~-100:100:6000 8 0 11 0 5   # ch11 pink bed reaches vol 8, held (-18 dB)

# --- Focus 10 base (03:00-08:00): bring in the 4 Hz SEPTON stack + 250/300[4.0] theta ---
A 180000 200 0 >0 0 8 204 7  # septon a 200->204 (4 Hz): vol fades 0->22 over 60 s
A 180000 204 0 >0 0 9 208 7  # septon b 204->208 (4 Hz)
A 180000 208 0 >0 0 10 212 7  # septon c 208->212 (4 Hz)
A 180000 250 0 >0 0 3 254 7  # ch3 theta 250[4.0]: vol fades 0->30 (secondary)
A 180000 300 0 >0 0 4 304 7  # ch4 theta 300[4.0]
S 180000 default 65 "Entering Focus Ten now — mind awake, body asleep. Rest at the threshold, calm and clear."
A 240000 200 0 22 0 8 204 7  # septon a reaches 22
A 240000 204 0 22 0 9 208 7  # septon b reaches 22
A 240000 208 0 22 0 10 212 7  # septon c reaches 22
A 240000 250 0 30 0 3 254 7  # ch3 reaches 30 (secondary, ~-7 dB)
A 240000 300 0 30 0 4 304 7  # ch4 reaches 30

# --- Extend to Focus 15 (08:00-09:00): fade IN the ~7 Hz upper-theta signature ---
A 480000 500 0 >0 0 5 507.05 7  # ch5 500[7.05]: vol fades 0->18 over 60 s
A 480000 630 0 >0 0 6 637.1 7  # ch6 630[7.1]
A 480000 750 0 >0 0 7 757 7  # ch7 750[7.0]
S 480000 default 65 "Expanding gently into Focus Fifteen. The edges of the clock begin to soften."
A 540000 500 0 18 0 5 507.05 7  # ch5 reaches 18 (signature, subtle -12 dB)
A 540000 630 0 18 0 6 637.1 7  # ch6 reaches 18
A 540000 750 0 18 0 7 757 7  # ch7 reaches 18

# --- No-Time hold (12:00-30:00 = 18 min): full stack, VERY steady, minimal change ---
S 720000 default 65 "Time is dissolving. There is no before and no after — only this. Rest here in the timeless."
S 1200000 default 65 "Nowhere to go, nothing to do. Let the stillness hold you completely."

# --- Return (30:00-34:00): fade the 7 Hz layers out, then a soft fade toward silence ---
A 1800000 500 0 >18 0 5 507.05 7  # ch5 7 Hz fades 18->0 over 90 s (leaving Focus 15)
A 1800000 630 0 >18 0 6 637.1 7  # ch6 fades out
A 1800000 750 0 >18 0 7 757 7  # ch7 fades out
S 1800000 default 65 "Slowly, gently, time returns. Begin to drift back toward the surface."
A 1890000 500 0 0 0 5 507.05 7  # ch5 silent
A 1890000 630 0 0 0 6 637.1 7  # ch6 silent
A 1890000 750 0 0 0 7 757 7  # ch7 silent
1890000 4 50 >22 90 0 200 15     # LED brightness begins soft fade 22->0
A 1920000 100 0 >20 0 1 101.5 7  # base layers fade to 0 over 120 s (liminal soft-off)
A 1920000 200 0 >22 0 8 204 7  # septon a fades 22->0
A 1920000 204 0 >22 0 9 208 7  # septon b fades out
A 1920000 208 0 >22 0 10 212 7  # septon c fades out
A 1920000 250 0 >30 0 3 254 7  # ch3 theta fades out
A 1920000 300 0 >30 0 4 304 7  # ch4 theta fades out
A 1920000 200 ~-100:100:6000 >8 0 11 0 5   # ch11 pink bed fades 8->0
S 2010000 default 65 "Let it all fade softly to quiet. You may rest, or open your eyes when you are ready."
A 2040000 100 0 0 0 1 101.5 7  # end: all volumes 0
A 2040000 200 0 0 0 8 204 7  # septon a silent
A 2040000 204 0 0 0 9 208 7  # septon b silent
A 2040000 208 0 0 0 10 212 7  # septon c silent
A 2040000 250 0 0 0 3 254 7
A 2040000 300 0 0 0 4 304 7
A 2040000 200 ~-100:100:6000 0 0 11 0 5   # ch11 pink bed silent
2040000 4 50 0 90 0 200 15       # end: brightness 0
